# Kazuul's Fury: the creature sacrificed to the additional cost dies as the spell is cast, so its own "when this creature
# dies" ability triggers and goes on the stack above the Fury. Bot1 sacrifices a Haywire Mite (1/1; "When this creature dies,
# you gain 2 life") on turn 3: the Mite's trigger resolves first (Bot1 at 22), then the Fury deals the Mite's power, 1, to Bot2.

